# No Hierarchy Name Lookup

NEVER locate GameObjects/Transforms/meshes (intact, Fractured, cells, etc.) by string name.

Forbidden:
- `name.Contains` / `IndexOf("Fractured")` / `transform.Find(...)`
- `GetChild` loops that decide identity from `child.name`
- Any runtime or editor "scan children until name matches" helper (e.g. CacheRoots)

Required:
- `[SerializeField]` Inspector drag-and-drop references
- Use arrays for multiple objects (`GameObject[] intactRoots`, `GameObject[] fracturedRoots`)
- Wire refs on the Prefab; do not invent hierarchy discovery code
